{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>WEATHERCAST 24 local forecast 是一款提供精細本地天氣預報的天氣 App，適合經常外出、規劃行程或需要掌握天氣變化的使用者。它原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-136.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>逐時與多日天氣預報</h2>\n<p>WEATHERCAST 24 local forecast 提供精細的本地天氣預報，讓使用者隨時隨地掌握最新天氣狀況。App 可顯示最多 48 小時的逐時數據，並提供最多 15 日天氣預報，方便安排行程。它同時接入全球數百萬個氣象站資料，呈現所需的各類天氣資訊。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-125-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-126-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-127-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-128-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：WEATHERCAST 24 local forecast</li><li>應用類別：Weather</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/weathercast-24-local-forecast/id1512214163?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.472804+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:23.688802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:19.781246+00:00","content_hash":"7997fa65135acb4fa1a24cbbf97f58718f0375e9c35233f80e2409220cd11c8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.472804+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}